                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rounded-lg border border-emerald-400/20 bg-emerald-400/[.04] p-4 text-center">
                            <p class="font-mono text-3xl font-semibold text-emerald-300">@(184 + Logs.Count) DAYS</p>
                            <p class="mt-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-emerald-200/80">Continuous Streak · Crew 02</p>
                            <p class="mt-2 text-[9px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
                                All daily health indicator checks and countermeasures completed successfully for the mission segment.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section class="rounded-xl border border-white/[.08] bg-[#0b121b] p-4">
                        <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2.5">
                            <span class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-cyan-400/15 bg-cyan-400/[.04] text-cyan-300">ⓘ</span>
                            <div>
                                <p class="text-[8px] tracking-[.14em] text-slate-600">EDUCATIONAL CONTEXT</p>
                                <h2 class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[.1em] text-slate-100">Why track vitals in deep space?</h2>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-[9px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
                            <p><strong class="text-slate-200">Fluid Shifts:</strong> In microgravity, blood and interstitial fluids shift toward the upper body, altering blood pressure and cardiovascular response.</p>
                            <p><strong class="text-slate-200">Bone Mineral Density:</strong> Lack of axial loading can lead to bone mineral density reduction; daily resistance sessions help mitigate this.</p>
                            <p><strong class="text-slate-200">Circadian Hygiene:</strong> Artificial lighting requires intentional sleep tracking and mood logging to support behavioral health.</p>
